Description: Propeller TUI — OwlTrail-powered terminal AI assistant
 Propeller is a terminal UI for AI-assisted development. It connects
 to the OwlTrail proxy (port 8081) and provides a full-featured chat
 interface with Propeller mode (auto-approve, max effort).
 .
 Includes owltrail_adapter.py for model name-to-ID translation.
